OL,3,GNEWSADeal worth #12bn announced to
OL,4,Abuild offshore wind farms
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #12bn deal to construct wind farms
OL,7,Fhas been described by Prime Minister
OL,8,FAndy Burnham as "a vote of confidence
OL,9,Ffor building in Britain".
OL,11,FEnergy company RWE and investment firm
OL,12,FKKR have announced the funding, which
OL,13,Fwill deliver the Vanguard West and
OL,14,FVanguard East offshore wind farms off
OL,15,Fthe Norfolk coast.
OL,17,FThe wind farms are expected to be fully
OL,18,Fcommissioned in 2030, with offshore
OL,19,Fconstruction scheduled to begin in
OL,20,Fearly 2027.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
