OL,3,GNEWSADeal worth #12bn announced to
OL,4,Abuild offshore wind farms
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It is great news for billpayers
OL,7,Fbecause every turbine we put up is
OL,8,Fpower under British control, not at the
OL,9,Fmercy of events on the other side of
OL,10,Fthe world," added Burnham, as he
OL,11,Fprepared to head to the Cop31 climate
OL,12,Fsummit.
